      "path": "/books/maani-al-akhbar:249:2",
      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/28/1/251/2",
      "text": [
        ": حدثنا محمد بن الحسن الصفار، قال: حدثنا إبراهيم بن هاشم، عن محمد بن أبي عمير، عن حمزة بن حمران قال: قال أبو عبد الله عليه السلام: إن من أجاب في كل ما يسأل  عنه لمجنون."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.basel-kadem": [
          "2.\tWe were told by Muhammed bin Hasan bin Ahmad bin Waleed, may Allah be pleased with him, that he said: We were told by Muhammed bin Hasan al-Saffar, that he said: We were told by Ibrahim bin Hashim, from Muhammed bin Abi ‘Umayr, from Hamza bin Hamran, that he said: Abu Abdillah, peace be upon him, said: Indeed, the one who answers in all he is asked, is surely insane."
        ]
      }
    },
